  "notes": "The projector can be powered by a USB-C power bank (45W minimum, PD protocol) but brightness will be limited to 50% (Full) or 30% (Eco). iPhone/iPad users require an additional adapter for HDMI connection. Supports HDCP 2.0/HDMI 2.2. Dual integrated theater-level Harman Kardon speakers. Local storage: 16GB total (10GB available). Input lag: 125ms. Supports resolutions up to 4K (3840x2160).",
